@startuml architecture-unstyled
title "Order Processing System (Default / Unstyled)"

!pragma layout smetana

node "Web Client" as WC
node "API Server" as API
node "Auth Service" as Auth
node "Order Service" as Orders
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
database "Redis Cache" as Cache
queue "RabbitMQ" as MQ
node "Email Service" as Email
node "Stripe API" as Stripe

WC      --> API     : HTTPS
API     --> Auth    : validate
API     --> Orders  : create order
Orders  --> DB      : persist
Orders  --> Cache   : cache result
Orders  --> MQ      : publish event
Orders  --> Stripe  : charge
MQ      --> Email   : send confirmation

@enduml
